"Could not add the entry — please provide a valid IPv4/v6 address or CIDR "
"range."
msgstr ""
"Impossible d'ajouter l'entrée. Veuillez indiquer une adresse IPv4/v6 ou une "
"plage CIDR valide."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:373
msgid "Testing connection…"
msgstr "Test de la connexion…"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:374
msgid "Please enter an access key first."
msgstr "Veuillez d'abord saisir une clé d'accès."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:375
msgid "Could not reach reportedip.com. Check your network and try again."
msgstr ""
"Impossible de joindre reportedip.com. Vérifiez votre réseau et réessayez."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:402
msgid "Active blocks"
msgstr "Blocages actifs"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:407
msgid "Blocks (last 24 h)"
msgstr "Blocages (dernières 24 h)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:412
msgid "Attempts (last 24 h)"
msgstr "Tentatives (dernières 24 h)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:417
msgid "Whitelisted IPs"
msgstr "IP en Whitelist"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:436
msgid "Last 24 h"
msgstr "Dernières 24 h"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:440
msgid "Last 7 days"
msgstr "7 derniers jours"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:444
msgid "Last 30 days"
msgstr "30 derniers jours"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:448
msgid "All time"
msgstr "Depuis le début"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:454
msgid "Defended attacks"
msgstr "Attaques repoussées"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:464
msgid ""
"Each block represents one IP that was prevented from logging in after "
"exceeding the configured thresholds."
msgstr ""
"Chaque blocage correspond à une IP empêchée de se connecter après avoir "
"dépassé les seuils configurés."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:469 admin/class-setup-wizard.php:185
#: admin/class-setup-wizard.php:296
msgid "Operation mode"
msgstr "Mode de fonctionnement"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:472
msgid "Community Network"
msgstr "Community Network"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:472
msgid "IP reputation lookups + queued reports active."
msgstr ""
"Vérifications de réputation des IP et file d'attente des signalements "
"actives."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:474
msgid "Local Shield"
msgstr "Local Shield"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:474
msgid ""
"No external requests. Switch to Community Network in Settings to enable "
"reputation lookups."
msgstr ""
"Aucune requête externe. Passez à Community Network dans les réglages pour "
"activer les vérifications de réputation."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:481
msgid "API health & quota"
msgstr "État et quota de l'API"

#. translators: 1: used calls, 2: max calls per hour
#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:491
#, php-format
msgid "Outbound calls this hour: %1$d / %2$d"
msgstr "Appels sortants cette heure : %1$d / %2$d"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:498
msgid ""
"Rolling 1-hour window. When exhausted, reputation lookups are skipped (login"
" still proceeds, fail-open)."
msgstr ""
"Fenêtre glissante d'une heure. Une fois le quota épuisé, les vérifications "
"de réputation sont ignorées (la connexion reste possible, mode fail-open)."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:504
msgid "Report queue"
msgstr "File d'attente des signalements"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:507
msgid "pending"
msgstr "en attente"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:508
msgid "processing"
msgstr "en cours"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:509
msgid "completed"
msgstr "terminé"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:510
msgid "failed"
msgstr "échoué"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:512
msgid ""
"Reports are queued in the database and dispatched by a 15-minute cron job — "
"never from the login path. Failed rows retry up to 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Les signalements sont mis en file d'attente dans la base de données et "
"envoyés par une tâche cron toutes les 15 minutes, jamais pendant la "
"connexion. Les lignes en échec sont retentées jusqu'à 3 fois."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:517
msgid "Recent activity"
msgstr "Activité récente"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:524
msgid "No login attempts recorded yet."
msgstr "Aucune tentative de connexion enregistrée pour l'instant."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:552
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Connexion"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:553 admin/class-setup-wizard.php:186
msgid "Protection"
msgstr "Protection"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:554
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Confidentialité"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:560
msgid "Brute-force protection for WordPress logins"
msgstr "Protection contre la force brute pour les connexions WordPress"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:585
msgid "Save Changes"
msgstr "Enregistrer les modifications"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:608
msgid "Blocked IP addresses"
msgstr "Adresses IP bloquées"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:656
msgid "IP whitelist"
msgstr "Whitelist des IP"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:664 admin/class-admin-settings.php:689
msgid "Add to whitelist"
msgstr "Ajouter à la Whitelist"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:672
msgid "IP address or CIDR range"
msgstr "Adresse IP ou plage CIDR"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:674
msgid "IPv4, IPv6 or IPv4 CIDR (e.g. 203.0.113.0/24)."
msgstr "IPv4, IPv6 ou CIDR IPv4 (par ex. 203.0.113.0/24)."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:678
msgid "Reason (optional)"
msgstr "Motif (facultatif)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:679
msgid "e.g. Office VPN"
msgstr "par ex. VPN du bureau"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:683
msgid "Expires (optional)"
msgstr "Expiration (facultatif)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:685
msgid "Leave blank for a permanent entry."
msgstr "Laissez vide pour une entrée permanente."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:697
msgid "Current whitelist"
msgstr "Whitelist actuelle"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:701
msgid "No whitelist entries yet."
msgstr "Aucune entrée dans la Whitelist pour l'instant."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:728 admin/class-admin-settings.php:752
#: reportedip-hive.php:468
msgid "Insufficient permissions."
msgstr "Droits insuffisants."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:757
msgid "Invalid IP address."
msgstr "Adresse IP non valide."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:777
msgid "None — use REMOTE_ADDR (default)"
msgstr "Aucun (utiliser REMOTE_ADDR, par défaut)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:787
msgid "Operation Mode"
msgstr "Mode de fonctionnement"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:792 admin/class-setup-wizard.php:301
msgid "Local Shield (recommended)"
msgstr "Local Shield (recommandé)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:793 admin/class-setup-wizard.php:302
msgid "Uses only your site's data. No external requests."
msgstr "Utilise uniquement les données de votre site. Aucune requête externe."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:798 admin/class-setup-wizard.php:307
msgid "Community Network (optional)"
msgstr "Community Network (facultatif)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:803
msgid "Enabling Community Network mode will:"
msgstr "L'activation du mode Community Network va :"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:805
msgid ""
"Send blocked IP addresses to reportedip.com when your site detects an "
"attack."
msgstr ""
"Envoyer les adresses IP bloquées à reportedip.com lorsque votre site détecte"
" une attaque."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:806
msgid "Query reportedip.com during login attempts to check IP reputation."
msgstr ""
"Interroger reportedip.com lors des tentatives de connexion pour vérifier la "
"réputation des IP."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:807
msgid ""
"Send only the IP address, a category ID and a short comment with each "
"report. Usernames never leave your server, neither in plain text nor hashed."
msgstr ""
"Envoyer uniquement l'adresse IP, un identifiant de catégorie et un court "
"commentaire avec chaque signalement. Les identifiants ne quittent jamais "
"votre serveur, ni en clair ni sous forme de hash."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:808
msgid ""
"Identify your site only via your Community Access Key — no domain or contact"
" information is transmitted."
msgstr ""
"Identifier votre site uniquement par votre Community Access Key. Aucun "
"domaine ni aucune coordonnée n'est transmis."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:810 reportedip-hive.php:405
msgid ""
"Legal basis: GDPR Art. 6(1)(f), legitimate interest in network security."
msgstr ""
"Base légale : RGPD art. 6, par. 1, point f), intérêt légitime à la sécurité "
"du réseau."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:818
msgid "Community Access Key"
msgstr "Community Access Key"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:821
msgid "Access Key"
msgstr "Clé d'accès"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:823
msgid "Need an access key? Visit reportedip.com."
msgstr "Besoin d'une clé d'accès ? Rendez-vous sur reportedip.com."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:827
msgid "API Endpoint"
msgstr "Point de terminaison de l'API"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:829
msgid ""
"Default endpoint. Override via the reportedip_hive_api_endpoint filter."
msgstr ""
"Point de terminaison par défaut. Modifiable via le filtre "
"reportedip_hive_api_endpoint."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:833
msgid "Test connection"
msgstr "Tester la connexion"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:840
msgid "Reverse Proxy"
msgstr "Proxy inverse"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:843
msgid "Trusted Proxy Header"
msgstr "En-tête de proxy de confiance"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:849
msgid ""
"Only set this if your site sits behind a reverse proxy (Cloudflare, AWS, "
"NGINX) that overrides the header for every incoming request. Otherwise the "
"header can be spoofed."
msgstr ""
"Ne réglez cette option que si votre site se trouve derrière un proxy inverse"
" (Cloudflare, AWS, NGINX) qui réécrit cet en-tête pour chaque requête "
"entrante. Sinon, l'en-tête peut être falsifié."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:873
msgid "Brute-force thresholds"
msgstr "Seuils de force brute"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:876 admin/class-setup-wizard.php:347
msgid "Failed-login threshold"
msgstr "Seuil d'échecs de connexion"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:878 admin/class-setup-wizard.php:349
msgid "Block an IP after this many failed login attempts."
msgstr "Bloquer une IP après ce nombre de tentatives de connexion échouées."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:881 admin/class-admin-settings.php:897
#: admin/class-setup-wizard.php:353
msgid "Time window (minutes)"
msgstr "Fenêtre de temps (minutes)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:883 admin/class-setup-wizard.php:355
msgid "Time window during which failed attempts are counted."
msgstr ""
"Fenêtre de temps pendant laquelle les tentatives échouées sont comptées."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:889
msgid "Password-spray detection"
msgstr "Détection de pulvérisation de mots de passe (password spraying)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:892
msgid "Distinct usernames threshold"
msgstr "Seuil d'identifiants distincts"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:894
msgid "Block an IP that fails logins against this many distinct usernames."
msgstr ""
"Bloquer une IP dont les connexions échouent sur ce nombre d'identifiants "
"distincts."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:904
msgid "Blocking behaviour"
msgstr "Comportement de blocage"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:908
msgid "Automatic blocking"
msgstr "Blocage automatique"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:910
msgid ""
"If disabled, attempts are logged but no block is enforced (report-only "
"mode)."
msgstr ""
"Si cette option est désactivée, les tentatives sont journalisées mais aucun "
"blocage n'est appliqué (mode signalement seul)."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:914
msgid "Progressive block duration"
msgstr "Durée de blocage progressive"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:916
msgid ""
"Increases block duration with each repeat offense (5 min → 15 min → 30 min →"
" 24 h → 48 h → 7 days)."
msgstr ""
"Augmente la durée du blocage à chaque récidive (5 min → 15 min → 30 min → 24"
" h → 48 h → 7 jours)."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:920
msgid "Report-only mode"
msgstr "Mode signalement seul"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:922
msgid ""
"Detect and report attacks but never block. Useful for staging environments."
msgstr ""
"Détecter et signaler les attaques sans jamais bloquer. Utile pour les "
"environnements de préproduction."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:925
msgid "Show advanced (block ladder)"
msgstr "Afficher les options avancées (paliers de blocage)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:927
msgid "Block ladder (CSV minutes)"
msgstr "Paliers de blocage (minutes, séparées par des virgules)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:949
msgid "Cache & retention"
msgstr "Cache et conservation"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:952
msgid "Reputation cache duration (hours)"
msgstr "Durée du cache de réputation (heures)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:956
msgid "Negative cache duration (hours)"
msgstr "Durée du cache négatif (heures)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:960
msgid "API queue retention (days)"
msgstr "Conservation de la file d'attente API (jours)"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:967
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Désinstaller"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:971
msgid "Delete all data on uninstall"
msgstr "Supprimer toutes les données lors de la désinstallation"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:973
msgid ""
"Drop all plugin tables and options when the plugin is deleted. Recommended "
"OFF for forensic reasons."
msgstr ""
"Supprime toutes les tables et options de l'extension lorsqu'elle est "
"supprimée. Il est recommandé de laisser cette option désactivée pour des "
"raisons d'analyse forensique."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:979
msgid "Privacy notice"
msgstr "Avis de confidentialité"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:980
msgid ""
"This plugin processes IP addresses to detect attacks. Username inputs are "
"stored hashed (SHA-256, salted with wp_salt()), never in plaintext. In Local"
" Shield mode, no data leaves your server. In Community Network mode, blocked"
" IP addresses are shared with reportedip.com together with an event category"
" and a short comment; usernames are never transmitted. See the readme.txt "
"\"External services\" and \"Privacy\" sections for full details."
msgstr ""
"Cette extension traite les adresses IP pour détecter les attaques. Les "
"identifiants saisis sont stockés sous forme de hash (SHA-256, salé avec "
"wp_salt()), jamais en clair. En mode Local Shield, aucune donnée ne quitte "
"votre serveur. En mode Community Network, les adresses IP bloquées sont "
"partagées avec reportedip.com, accompagnées d'une catégorie d'événement et "
"d'un court commentaire. Les identifiants ne sont jamais transmis. Consultez "
"les sections « External services » et « Privacy » du fichier readme.txt pour"
" tous les détails."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:997
msgid "No blocked IPs yet"
msgstr "Aucune IP bloquée pour l'instant"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:998
msgid ""
"When the plugin blocks an attacker, you will see them listed here. Configure"
" thresholds in Settings → Protection."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque l'extension bloque un attaquant, il apparaît ici. Configurez les "
"seuils dans Réglages → Protection."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:999
msgid "Configure Protection"
msgstr "Configurer la protection"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:1086
msgid ""
"Hive Light is complete and stays free. Need a Web Application Firewall, two-"
"factor authentication or multisite support? The free Full Edition and the "
"optional Hive PRO subscription build on the same engine."
msgstr ""
"Hive Light est complète et reste gratuite. Besoin d'un pare-feu applicatif "
"web, de l'authentification à deux facteurs ou de la prise en charge "
"multisite ? La Full Edition gratuite et l'abonnement facultatif Hive PRO "
"reposent sur le même moteur."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:1088
msgid "ReportedIP Hive Full Edition & PRO"
msgstr "ReportedIP Hive Full Edition & PRO"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:1107
msgid "Security Focused"
msgstr "Security Focused"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:1111
msgid "GDPR Compliant"
msgstr "GDPR Compliant"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:1115
msgid "Made in Germany"
msgstr "Made in Germany"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:1137
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Réglages enregistrés."

#: admin/class-attempts-list-table.php:64 admin/class-blocked-ips-table.php:65
msgid "IP Address"
msgstr "Adresse IP"

#: admin/class-attempts-list-table.php:65 admin/class-blocked-ips-table.php:67
